1
00:00:00,891 --> 00:00:03,141
(Howard:)...and spit in my hair.

2
00:00:07,022 --> 00:00:09,652
Which brings us to 10th grade.

3
00:00:10,525 --> 00:00:13,275
(Penny:)Howard, do you think
maybe sometimes...

4
00:00:13,445 --> 00:00:15,365
(Penny:)...you try too hard?

5
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,860
[SCOFFS]

6
00:00:17,574 --> 00:00:19,454
(Howard:)Look at me.

7
00:00:19,618 --> 00:00:23,158
(Howard:)What chance do I have
if I don't try too hard?

8
00:00:24,373 --> 00:00:27,253
Well, you have a terrific chance.

9
00:00:27,417 --> 00:00:29,627
(Penny:)You're smart, you're funny,
you have a cool job.

10
00:00:29,795 --> 00:00:33,385
(Penny:)- You build stuff that goes into outer space.
- I guess.

11
00:00:33,548 --> 00:00:35,838
No, look, I've known you
for a year and a half...

12
00:00:36,009 --> 00:00:40,059
(Penny:)...and this is the first time
I feel like I'm talking to a real person.

13
00:00:40,222 --> 00:00:42,262
(Penny:)And you know what? I like him.

14
00:00:42,849 --> 00:00:45,099
(Penny:)He's a nice guy.

15
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,060
(Howard:)You really think so?

16
00:00:47,229 --> 00:00:48,609
(Leonard:)Yes.

17
00:00:49,147 --> 00:00:50,987
(Leonard:)I don't know.

18
00:00:51,149 --> 00:00:53,399
No, I do.

19
00:00:53,902 --> 00:00:55,232
[CHUCKLES]

20
00:00:56,071 --> 00:01:09,031
[HEARTBEAT POUNDING
IN SLOW MOTION]

